# Drax Productions

A modern and responsive website for **Drax Productions**, designed to showcase creative production and digital services.

## ✨ Features

* Modern and responsive design
* Creative landing page
* Services showcase
* Projects / Portfolio section
* Team section
* Contact section
* Smooth animations and interactions
* Responsive layout for different screen sizes

## 🛠️ Technologies

* HTML5
* CSS3
* JavaScript

## 📱 Responsive Design

The website is fully responsive and optimized for:

* Desktop
* Tablet
* Mobile

